      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daaqoó Daudi kudá' taa laqwaál baraá Hebroni alé, a Amnoni, garmoó baris, aayoorós a Ahinoamu ar yaamaá Yesre'eli. Garmoó tsár a Danieli aayoorós a Abigaili, ar Karmeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Garmoó tám a Absalomu, aayoorós a Ma'aka dasír Talmai, waawutmoó Geshuri. Garmoó tsiyáhh a Adoniya, aayoorós a Hagiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Garmoó kooán a Shefatia, aayoorós a Abitali. Garmoó lahhoó' a Itreamu, aayoorós a Egla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuká' sleémeero lahhoamaawo kina laqwaál baraá Hebroni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ina waawuti'ín baraá Hebroni wa ale kureeri faanqw nee slahheeraá lahhoó', nee baraá Yerusalemuro kureeri mibeeri tám nee tám.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daaqoó tsiyáhh oo Bat-shua dasír Amieli aa laqwál baraá yaamaá Yerusalemú wa alé a kwí: shimea nee Shobabu, nee Natani, nee Solomon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi daaqoó hatlá' oo gwaleél gu kón, a ín Ibhari, nee Elishua nee Elifaleti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee Noga, nee Nefegi, nee Yafia ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee Elishama, nee Eliada, nee Elifeleti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuká' sleémeero a daaqoó Daudi aa laqwaál, daaqoó hatlá' oo taa laqwaál nee /ameenadá' quturmo wasl i deer. Inós sleeme dasi ga kón ar ta bay Tamari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon ina laqwaál Rehoboamu, Rehoboamu ina laqwaál Abiya, Abiya ina laqwaál Asa, Asa ina laqwaál Yehoshafati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafati ina laqwaál Yehoramu, Yehoramu ina laqwaál Ahasia, nee Ahasia ina laqwaál Yoashi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoashi ina laqwaál Amasia, Amasia ina laqwaál Usia, Usia ina laqwaál Yotam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yotam ina laqwaál Ahasi, Ahasi ina laqwaál Hesekia, Hesekia ina laqwaál Manase, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manase ina laqwaál Amoni, Amoni ina laqwaál Yosia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daaqoó Yosia a kwí tsiyáhh: Yohanani a garmoó baris, oo tsár a Yehoyakimu nee oo tám a Sedekia, oo tsiyáhh a Shalumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daaqoó Yehoyakimu a kwí: Yekonia nee Sedekia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yekonia a kudá' taa huúw baraá lawaali'iimár yaamaá Babuloni, daaqaywós a kwí: Shealtieli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee Malkiramu, nee Pedaya, nee Shenasari, nee Yekamia nee Hoshama, nee Nedabia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee daaqoó Pedaya a kwí: Serubabeli nee Shimei. Daaqoó Serubabeli a kwí: Meshulamu nee Hanania, nee hho'or'ín a Shelomiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Serubabeli daaqoó hatlá' oo kooán gu kón sleeme, a ín Hashuba, nee Oheli, nee Berekia, nee Hasadia, nee Yushab-hesedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanania ina laqwaál Pelatia, Pelatia ina laqwaál Yeshaya, Yeshaya ina laqwaál Refaya, Refaya ina laqwaál Arnani, Arnani ina laqwaál Obadia, Obadia ina laqwaál Shekania. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shekania ina laqwaál Shemaya, Shemaya daaqaywós a kwí: Hatushi, nee Igali, nee Baria, nee Nearia, nee Shafati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daaqoó Nearia a kwí tám: Elieonai nee Hiskia, nee Asrikamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daaqoó Elieonai a kwí faanqw: Hodafia, nee Eliashibu, nee Pelaya, nee Akubu, nee Yohanani, nee Delaya, nee Anani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
